# Line endings this repository ships. The page's assets are inlined into every
# page of a release, and `_page_file` reads them with their CRLF normalised,
# so a CRLF checkout cannot change a page's bytes (tests/test_page_assets.py).
# The eol=lf rule keeps the working tree and the blob the same file, so
# `test_no_asset_carries_a_carriage_return` -- a claim about the bytes the
# asset holds -- is true on a Windows checkout as it is in CI.
/.gitattributes text eol=lf
page/*.css text eol=lf
page/*.js text eol=lf
